w8: $ G , k ∊ ω , h ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn h ⊆ {x0 | ∀ x1 (x1 ∊ fv tsub x0 → fv tsub x1 ⊆ fv tsub x0)} ⇒ ⟨ k , h ⟩ ∈ {x0 | ∀ x1 (x1 ∊ fv tsub x0 → fv tsub x1 ⊆ fv tsub x0)} $ by wcel_cab_intro [w7, w6]
