tsub_kid2
---------
k0a: $ G ⇒ scons C S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by scons_fseq_c [#4, #5]
k0: $ G ⇒ scons B (scons C S) ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by scons_fseq_c [#3, k0a]
k1: $ G ⇒ scons A (scons B (scons C S)) ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by scons_fseq_c [#2, k0]
k2: $ G ⇒ isset C $ by wcel_isset [#4]
k3: $ G ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
k3b: $ G ⇒ isset (suc ∅) $ by suc_set [k3]
k3c: $ G ⇒ isset (suc (suc ∅)) $ by suc_set [k3b]
k5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , C ⟩ ∈ scons C S $ by c1_scons_zero
k5b: $ G ⇒ ⟨ suc ∅ , C ⟩ ∈ scons B (scons C S) $ by c1_scons_suc [k3, k2, k5]
k6: $ G ⇒ ⟨ suc (suc ∅) , C ⟩ ∈ scons A (scons B (scons C S)) $ by c1_scons_suc [k3b, k2, k5b]
k7: $ G ⇒ C ∈ fv tsub ⟨ K , scons A (scons B (scons C S)) ⟩ $ by c1_kid [#1, k1, k2, k3c, k6]

tsub_crn
--------
l1: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
l2: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ by cdm_intro [l1]
l3: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
l4: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [l3]
l5: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv s i = y $ by fv_val [l4, l1]
l6a: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ s ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by welc_wcel [l3]
l6: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv tsub (fv s i) ⊆ psub s $ by psub_child [l6a, l2]
l7: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv s i ∈ trees ω $ by fseq_fv [l3, l2]
l8: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv s i ∈ fv tsub (fv s i) $ by tsub_self [l7]
l9: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv s i ∈ psub s $ by wcel_subset [l6, l8]
l10: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∈ psub s $ by wcel_eq_l [l5, l9]
l11: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∊ psub s $ by wcel_welc [l10]
l12: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∊ csn ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∪ psub s $ by cun_intro_r [l11]
l13: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
l14: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ = csn ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∪ psub s $ by tsub_node [l13, l3]
l15: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ csn ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∪ psub s = fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by eq_sym [l14]
l16: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∊ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by welc_eq [l15, l12]
l17: $ G , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ y ∈ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by welc_wcel [l16]
l18: $ G ⇒ y ∈ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by crn_elim [#3, l17]

cvf_functional
--------------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr3 k j v (cvb u H k j v)) $ by cgr3_functional
l2w: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2: $ G ⇒ functional (trc ω (cgr3 k j v (cvb u H k j v))) $ by trc_functional_c [l2w, l1]

lemma c1_cvv_sub (G: hyps) (S V W: class): $ G ⇒ V = W $ > $ G ⇒ cvv S V ⊆ cvv S W $
----
p1: $ G , z ∊ cvv S V ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ i ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i))} $ by ax
p2: $ G , z ∊ cvv S V ⇒ ∃ i ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i)) $ by cab_elim [p1]
d0: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) $ by ax
d1: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [d0]
d2: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) $ by and_elim_r [d0]
d3: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ i ∊ cdm S $ by and_elim_l [d2]
d4: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) $ by and_elim_r [d2]
d5: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ V = W $ by weaken [#1]
d6: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
d7: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ fv V i = fv W i $ by fv_eq [d5, d6]
d8: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ fv S i = fv S i $ by eq_refl
d9: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ fv (fv V i) (fv S i) = fv (fv W i) (fv S i) $ by fv_eq [d7, d8]
d10: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i) $ by eq_trans [d4, d9]
d11: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i) $ by and_intro [d3, d10]
d12: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i) $ by and_intro [d1, d11]
d13: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i)) $ by ex_intro [d12]
d14: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ ∃ i ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i)) $ by ex_intro [d13]
d15: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ i ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv W i) (fv S i))} $ by cab_intro [d14]
d16: $ G , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i) ⇒ z ∊ cvv S W $ by weaken [d15]
e0: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i)) ⇒ ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i)) $ by ax
e1: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm S ∧ y = fv (fv V i) (fv S i)) ⇒ z ∊ cvv S W $ by ex_elim [e0, d16]
f1: $ G , z ∊ cvv S V ⇒ z ∊ cvv S W $ by ex_elim [p2, e1]
f2: $ G ⇒ cvv S V ⊆ cvv S W $ by subset_intro [f1]

lemma c1_cvv_eqV (G: hyps) (S V W: class): $ G ⇒ V = W $ > $ G ⇒ cvv S V = cvv S W $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ cvv S V ⊆ cvv S W $ by c1_cvv_sub [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ W = V $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ cvv S W ⊆ cvv S V $ by c1_cvv_sub [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ cvv S V = cvv S W $ by subset_antisym [l1, l3]

lemma c1_cvb_eqV (G: hyps) (U H K S V W: class): $ G ⇒ V = W $ > $ G ⇒ cvb U H K S V = cvb U H K S W $
----
v1: $ G ⇒ crn V = crn W $ by crn_eq [#1]
v2: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn V) = ⋃ (crn W) $ by cuni_eq [v1]
v3: $ G ⇒ cvv S V = cvv S W $ by c1_cvv_eqV [#1]
v4: $ G ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
v5: $ G ⇒ K = K $ by eq_refl
v6: $ G ⇒ U = U $ by eq_refl
v7: $ G ⇒ H = H $ by eq_refl
v8: $ G ⇒ ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ = ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v4, v2]
v9: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v5, v8]
v10: $ G ⇒ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v6, v9]
v11: $ G ⇒ fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [v7, v10]
v12: $ G ⇒ ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ = ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v4, v3]
v13: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v5, v12]
v14: $ G ⇒ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v6, v13]
v15: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v14, v11]
v16: $ G ⇒ csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by csn_eq [v15]
v17: $ G ⇒ dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S V) = dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S W) $ by dnb_eq [v6, v16, v5, v4, v3]
v18: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ by eq_refl
v19: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S V) ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S W) ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v18, v17]
v20: $ G ⇒ csn ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S V) ⟩ = csn ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S W) ⟩ $ by csn_eq [v19]
v21: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn V) ∪ csn ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S V ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn V) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S V) ⟩ = ⋃ (crn W) ∪ csn ⟨ ⟨ K , S ⟩ , dnb U (csn ⟨ ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , cvv S W ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ U , ⟨ K , ⟨ S , ⋃ (crn W) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) K S (cvv S W) ⟩ $ by cun_eq [v2, v20]
v22: $ G ⇒ cvb U H K S V = cvb U H K S W $ by weaken [v21]

cvf_node
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) $ by cgr3_functional
l2w: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2: $ G ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⟩ ⟩ $ by trc_node_c [l2w, l1, #1, #2]
l3: $ G ⇒ functional (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) $ by trc_functional_c [l2w, l1]
l4: $ G ⇒ isset s $ by isset_var
l5: $ G ⇒ isset (ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s) $ by ccom_set [l3, l4]
i1: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset h $ by isset_var
i2: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset (crn h) $ by crn_set [i1]
i3: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset (⋃ (crn h)) $ by cuni_set [i2]
i4: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , dnb u (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , cvv s h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ⋃ (crn h) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) k s (cvv s h) ⟩ $ by opair_isset
i5: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset (csn ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , dnb u (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , cvv s h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ⋃ (crn h) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) k s (cvv s h) ⟩) $ by csn_set [i4]
i6: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset (⋃ (crn h) ∪ csn ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , dnb u (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , cvv s h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ⋃ (crn h) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) k s (cvv s h) ⟩) $ by cun_set [i3, i5]
h1: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ isset (cvb u H k s h) $ by weaken [i6]
h2: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , h ⟩ ⟩ = cvb u H k s h $ by fv_cgr3 [h1]
h3: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s $ by ax
h4: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s = h $ by eq_sym [h3]
h5: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ s = s $ by eq_refl
h6: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ ⟨ s , ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⟩ = ⟨ s , h ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h5, h4]
h7: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ k = k $ by eq_refl
h8: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ k , ⟨ s , h ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h7, h6]
h9: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c) = cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c) $ by eq_refl
h10: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⟩ ⟩ = fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , h ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [h9, h8]
h12: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [l2]
h13: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c)) ⟨ k , ⟨ s , h ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [h12, h10]
h14: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = cvb u H k s h $ by eq_trans [h13, h2]
h15: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ cvb u H k s h = cvb u H k s (ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s) $ by c1_cvb_eqV [h3]
h16: $ G , h = ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = cvb u H k s (ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s) $ by eq_trans [h14, h15]
l9: $ G ⇒ fv (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = cvb u H k s (ccom (trc ω (cgr3 a b c (cvb u H a b c))) s) $ by isset_elim [l5, h16]

cvf_cdm
-------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr3 k j v (cvb u H k j v)) $ by cgr3_functional
l2w: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2: $ G ⇒ cdm (trc ω (cgr3 k j v (cvb u H k j v))) = trees ω $ by trc_cdm_c [l2w, l1]

lemma c1_cres_monoA (G: hyps) (R A B: class): $ G ⇒ A ⊆ B $ > $ G ⇒ cres R A ⊆ cres R B $
----
c1: $ G , z ∊ cres R A ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R)} $ by ax
c2: $ G , z ∊ cres R A ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) $ by cab_elim [c1]
d0: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by ax
d1: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [d0]
d2: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by and_elim_r [d0]
d3: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ x ∊ A $ by and_elim_l [d2]
d4: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by and_elim_r [d2]
d5: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ A ⊆ B $ by weaken [#1]
d6: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ x ∊ B $ by subset_elim [d5, d3]
d7: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by and_intro [d6, d4]
d8: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by and_intro [d1, d7]
d9: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) $ by ex_intro [d8]
d10: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) $ by ex_intro [d9]
d11: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R)} $ by cab_intro [d10]
d12: $ G , z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z ∊ cres R B $ by weaken [d11]
e0: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) ⇒ ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) $ by ax
e1: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) ⇒ z ∊ cres R B $ by ex_elim [e0, d12]
f1: $ G , z ∊ cres R A ⇒ z ∊ cres R B $ by ex_elim [c2, e1]
f2: $ G ⇒ cres R A ⊆ cres R B $ by subset_intro [f1]

lemma c1_crn_ccom (G: hyps) (F: class) (s c: set): $ G ⇒ functional F $ > $ G ⇒ c ∊ crn s $ > $ G ⇒ c ∊ cdm F $ > $ G ⇒ fv F c ∈ crn (ccom F s) $
----
n1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , fv F c ⟩ ∈ F $ by fv_in [#1, #3]
n2: $ G ⇒ isset (fv F c) $ by fv_set [#1]
p1: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
p2: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ e = fv F c $ by ax
p2b: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv F c = e $ by eq_sym [p2]
p3: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ c = c $ by eq_refl
p4: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ c , fv F c ⟩ = ⟨ c , e ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p3, p2b]
p4b: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ c , fv F c ⟩ ∈ F $ by weaken [n1]
p5: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ c , e ⟩ ∈ F $ by wcel_eq_l [p4, p4b]
p6: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ ⟨ i , e ⟩ ∈ ccom F s $ by ccom_intro [p1, p5]
p7: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ e ∊ crn (ccom F s) $ by crn_intro [p6]
p8: $ G , e = fv F c , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s ⇒ fv F c ∈ crn (ccom F s) $ by wcel_intro [p2, p7]
q1: $ G , e = fv F c ⇒ fv F c ∈ crn (ccom F s) $ by crn_elim [#2, p8]
q2: $ G ⇒ fv F c ∈ crn (ccom F s) $ by isset_elim [n2, q1]

lemma c1_crn_ccom_cases {c: set} (G H: hyps) (F: class) (s y: set) (d: fml): $ G ⇒ functional F $ > $ G ⇒ y ∊ crn (ccom F s) $ > $ H , c ∊ crn s , y = fv F c ⇒ d $ > $ G , H ⇒ d $
----
g1: $ H , c ∊ crn s ⇒ y = fv F c → d $ by imp_intro [#3]
g2: $ H ⇒ c ∊ crn s → y = fv F c → d $ by imp_intro [g1]
e1: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s $ by ax
e2: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ c ∊ crn s $ by crn_intro [e1]
e3: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
e4: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F $ by ax
e5: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ fv F c = y $ by fv_val [e3, e4]
e6: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ y = fv F c $ by eq_sym [e5]
e9: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ c ∊ crn s → y = fv F c → d $ by weaken [g2]
e10: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ y = fv F c → d $ by imp_elim [e9, e2]
e11: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s , ⟨ i , c ⟩ ∈ s , ⟨ c , y ⟩ ∈ F ⇒ d $ by imp_elim [e10, e6]
f1: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s $ by ax
f2: $ G , H , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ ccom F s ⇒ d $ by ccom_elim [f1, e11]
k1: $ G , H ⇒ d $ by crn_elim [#2, f2]

lemma c1_uc {c: set} (G: hyps) (F D: class) (s: set): $ G ⇒ functional F $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ cdm F = trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ c (c ∊ crn s → fv F c = cres D (fv tsub c)) $ > $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) = cres D (psub s) $
----
a0: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ ∀ c (c ∊ crn s → fv F c = cres D (fv tsub c)) $ by weaken [#4]
a1: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s → fv F x5 = cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by all_elim [a0]
a2: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s $ by ax
a3: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ fv F x5 = cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by imp_elim [a1, a2]
a4: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ y = fv F x5 $ by ax
a5: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ y = cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by eq_trans [a4, a3]
a6: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ z ∊ y $ by ax
a7: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ z ∊ cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by welc_eq [a5, a6]
a8a: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 , x6 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s $ by ax
a8b: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 , x6 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x6 ∊ fv tsub x5 $ by ax
a8: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 , x6 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x6 ∊ psub s $ by psub_intro [a8a, a8b]
a9: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ fv tsub x5 ⊆ psub s $ by subset_intro [a8]
a10: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ cres D (fv tsub x5) ⊆ cres D (psub s) $ by c1_cres_monoA [a9]
a11: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y , x5 ∊ crn s , y = fv F x5 ⇒ z ∊ cres D (psub s) $ by subset_elim [a10, a7]
b1: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
b2: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y ⇒ y ∊ crn (ccom F s) $ by ax
b3: $ G , y ∊ crn (ccom F s) , z ∊ y ⇒ z ∊ cres D (psub s) $ by c1_crn_ccom_cases [b1, b2, a11]
b4: $ G , z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by ax
b5: $ G , z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) ⇒ z ∊ cres D (psub s) $ by cuni_elim [b4, b3]
c1: $ G , z ∊ cres D (psub s) ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D)} $ by ax
c2: $ G , z ∊ cres D (psub s) ⇒ ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D) $ by cab_elim [c1]
d0: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D $ by ax
d1: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [d0]
d2: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D $ by and_elim_r [d0]
d3: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x7 ∊ psub s $ by and_elim_l [d2]
d4: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D $ by and_elim_r [d2]
g0: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ ∀ c (c ∊ crn s → fv F c = cres D (fv tsub c)) $ by weaken [#4]
g1: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s → fv F x5 = cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by all_elim [g0]
g2: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s $ by ax
g3: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ fv F x5 = cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by imp_elim [g1, g2]
g4: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 $ by ax
g5: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D $ by weaken [d4]
g6: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by cres_intro [g4, g5]
g7: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ $ by weaken [d1]
g7b: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [g7]
g8: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ z ∈ cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by wcel_eq_l [g7b, g6]
g9: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ z ∊ cres D (fv tsub x5) $ by wcel_welc [g8]
g10: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ cres D (fv tsub x5) = fv F x5 $ by eq_sym [g3]
g11: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ z ∊ fv F x5 $ by welc_eq [g10, g9]
g12: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
g13: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
g14: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ crn s ⊆ trees ω $ by fseq_crn [g13]
g15: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ trees ω $ by subset_elim [g14, g2]
g16: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ cdm F = trees ω $ by weaken [#3]
g17: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ trees ω = cdm F $ by eq_sym [g16]
g18: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ x5 ∊ cdm F $ by welc_eq [g17, g15]
g19: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ fv F x5 ∈ crn (ccom F s) $ by c1_crn_ccom [g12, g2, g18]
h1: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ e = fv F x5 $ by ax
h1b: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ fv F x5 = e $ by eq_sym [h1]
h2: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ z ∊ fv F x5 $ by weaken [g11]
h3: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ z ∊ e $ by welc_eq [h1b, h2]
h4: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ e ∊ crn (ccom F s) $ by ax
h5: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 , e = fv F x5 , e ∊ crn (ccom F s) ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by cuni_intro [h3, h4]
g20: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D , x5 ∊ crn s , x7 ∊ fv tsub x5 ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by wcel_elim [g19, h5]
d5: $ G , z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by psub_elim [d3, g20]
e0: $ G , ∃ x8 (z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D) ⇒ ∃ x8 (z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D) $ by ax
e1: $ G , ∃ x8 (z = ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∧ x7 ∊ psub s ∧ ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ∈ D) ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by ex_elim [e0, d5]
e2: $ G , z ∊ cres D (psub s) ⇒ z ∊ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) $ by ex_elim [c2, e1]
f1: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn (ccom F s)) = cres D (psub s) $ by eq_intro [b5, e2]

lemma c1_fvfv {c: set} (G: hyps) (F D: class) (s i: set): $ G ⇒ functional F $ > $ G ⇒ functional D $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ cdm F = trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ c (c ∊ crn s → fv F c = cres D (fv tsub c)) $ > $ G ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ > $ G ⇒ fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) = fv D (fv s i) $
----
n1: $ G ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [#3]
n2: $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ ∈ s $ by fv_in [n1, #6]
n3: $ G ⇒ isset (fv s i) $ by fv_set [n1]
c1: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ x5 = fv s i $ by ax
c1b: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ fv s i = x5 $ by eq_sym [c1]
c1c: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
c2: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ = ⟨ i , x5 ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c1c, c1b]
c2b: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ ⟨ i , fv s i ⟩ ∈ s $ by weaken [n2]
c3: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ ⟨ i , x5 ⟩ ∈ s $ by wcel_eq_l [c2, c2b]
c4: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ x5 ∊ crn s $ by crn_intro [c3]
c5a: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#3]
c5: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ crn s ⊆ trees ω $ by fseq_crn [c5a]
c6: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ x5 ∊ trees ω $ by subset_elim [c5, c4]
c7a: $ G , x5 = fv s i ⇒ cdm F = trees ω $ by weaken [#4]
