b4: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) ⇒ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) $ by and_elim_r [b2]
wa1: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
