b5: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) ⇒ fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) = fv D (fv s i) $ by c1_fvfv [wa1, wa2, wa3, wa4, wa5, b3]
b6: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) ⇒ y = fv D (fv s i) $ by eq_trans [b4, b5]
b7: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) ⇒ functional s $ by fseq_functional [wa3]
