c1: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) , x5 = fv s i ⇒ x5 = fv s i $ by ax
c1b: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) , x5 = fv s i ⇒ fv s i = x5 $ by eq_sym [c1]
