c9: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) , x5 = fv s i ⇒ y = fv D x5 $ by eq_trans [c9c, c9b]
c9d: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) , x5 = fv s i ⇒ fv D x5 = y $ by eq_sym [c9]
