c10: $ G , w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i) , x5 = fv s i ⇒ ⟨ x5 , fv D x5 ⟩ = ⟨ x5 , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c9e, c9d]
