h12: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) , ⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ cdm s ∧ x7 = fv (fv (ccom F s) x6) (fv s x6) $ by and_intro [h12a, h11]
h13: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) , ⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ ∃ y (w = ⟨ x6 , y ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) x6) (fv s x6)) $ by ex_intro [h12]
h14: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) , ⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ ∃ i ∃ y (w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i)) $ by ex_intro [h13]
h15: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) , ⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ w ∊ {w | ∃ i ∃ y (w = ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∧ i ∊ cdm s ∧ y = fv (fv (ccom F s) i) (fv s i))} $ by cab_intro [h14]
h16: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) , ⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ w ∊ cvv s (ccom F s) $ by weaken [h15]
g3: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) ⇒ w ∊ cvv s (ccom F s) $ by ex_elim [g2, h16]
e3: $ G , ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D)) ⇒ ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D)) $ by ax
e4: $ G , ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ ∃ x8 (⟨ x6 , x8 ⟩ ∈ s ∧ ⟨ x8 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D)) ⇒ w ∊ cvv s (ccom F s) $ by ex_elim [e3, g3]
e5: $ G , w ∊ ccom D s ⇒ w ∊ cvv s (ccom F s) $ by ex_elim [f2, e4]
f9: $ G ⇒ cvv s (ccom F s) = ccom D s $ by eq_intro [e2, e5]

lemma c1_cres_node (G: hyps) (D B: class) (a: set): $ G ⇒ functional D $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ cdm D $ > $ G ⇒ cres D (csn a ∪ B) = cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $
----
a1: $ G , w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) ⇒ w ∊ {w | ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D)} $ by ax
a2: $ G , w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) ⇒ ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) $ by cab_elim [a1]
b0: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by ax
