b2: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by and_elim_r [b0]
b3: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B $ by and_elim_l [b2]
b4: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by and_elim_r [b2]
b5: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x6 ∊ csn a ∨ x6 ∊ B $ by cun_elim [b3]
c0: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ x6 ∊ csn a $ by ax
c1: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ x6 = a $ by csn_elim [c0]
c2a: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ functional D $ by weaken [#1]
c2b: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by weaken [b4]
c2: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ fv D x6 = x7 $ by fv_val [c2a, c2b]
c3a: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
c3: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ fv D x6 = fv D a $ by fv_eq [c3a, c1]
c3b: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ x7 = fv D x6 $ by eq_sym [c2]
c4: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ x7 = fv D a $ by eq_trans [c3b, c3]
c5: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ = ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c1, c4]
c6a: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ $ by weaken [b1]
c6: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ w = ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by eq_trans [c6a, c5]
c7: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by csn_intro [c6]
c8: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ csn a ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by cun_intro_r [c7]
d0: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ x6 ∊ B $ by ax
d0b: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by weaken [b4]
d1: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ cres D B $ by cres_intro [d0, d0b]
d2a: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ $ by weaken [b1]
d2: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [d2a]
d3: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ w ∈ cres D B $ by wcel_eq_l [d2, d1]
d4: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ w ∊ cres D B $ by wcel_welc [d3]
d5: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D , x6 ∊ B ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by cun_intro_l [d4]
b6: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by or_elim [b5, c8, d5]
e0: $ G , ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) ⇒ ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) $ by ax
e1: $ G , ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ csn a ∪ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by ex_elim [e0, b6]
e2: $ G , w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by ex_elim [a2, e1]
f0: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by ax
f1: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ cres D B ∨ w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by cun_elim [f0]
g1: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ cres D B ⇒ w ∊ {w | ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D)} $ by ax
g2: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ cres D B ⇒ ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D) $ by cab_elim [g1]
