h2: $ G , w = ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∧ x6 ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D ⇒ x6 ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by and_elim_r [h0]
