e5: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ cres D B ⇒ w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) $ by ex_elim [g2, e4]
k0: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by ax
k1: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by csn_elim [k0]
