k3: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ csn a $ by csn_intro_var
k4: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ csn a ∪ B $ by cun_intro_l [k3]
k5: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ isset (fv D a) $ by fv_set [k2a]
m1: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ x7 = fv D a $ by ax
m1b: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ fv D a = x7 $ by eq_sym [m1]
m1c: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
m2: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ = ⟨ a , x7 ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m1c, m1b]
m2b: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ∈ D $ by weaken [k2]
m3: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ ⟨ a , x7 ⟩ ∈ D $ by wcel_eq_l [m2, m2b]
m3b: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ a ∊ csn a ∪ B $ by weaken [k4]
m4: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ ⟨ a , x7 ⟩ ∈ cres D (csn a ∪ B) $ by cres_intro [m3b, m3]
m5a: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ w = ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ $ by weaken [k1]
m5: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ w = ⟨ a , x7 ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m5a, m2]
m6: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ ⟨ a , x7 ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [m5]
m7: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ w ∈ cres D (csn a ∪ B) $ by wcel_eq_l [m6, m4]
m8: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , x7 = fv D a ⇒ w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) $ by wcel_welc [m7]
k6: $ G , w ∊ cres D B ∪ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ , w ∊ csn ⟨ a , fv D a ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ cres D (csn a ∪ B) $ by isset_elim [k5, m8]
