lemma c1_mcv_ap (G: hyps) (H: class) (u k h v: set): $ G ⇒ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ap (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , ⋃ (crn (ccom (cvf u H) h)) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $
----
a0: $ G , y ∊ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
a1: $ G , y ∊ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∈ mcv H $ by ap_elim [a0]
