m9: $ G , y ∊ ap (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , ⋃ (crn (ccom (cvf u H) h)) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , z = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ , z ∊ csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , ⋃ (crn (ccom (cvf u H) h)) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ap_intro [m8]
d2: $ G , y ∊ ap (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , ⋃ (crn (ccom (cvf u H) h)) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by wcel_elim [d1, m9]
f1: $ G ⇒ ap (mcv H) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ap (csn ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , fv H ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , ⋃ (crn (ccom (cvf u H) h)) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⟨ u , ⟨ k , ⟨ h , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_intro [e8, d2]

lemma c1_cvf_step {c: set} (G: hyps) (H: class) (u k h z: set): $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ h ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ k , h ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ c (c ∊ crn h → fv (cvf u H) c = cres (dnf u (mcv H)) (fv tsub c)) $ > $ G ⇒ fv (cvf u H) z = cres (dnf u (mcv H)) (fv tsub z) $
