n2: $ G , k = cdm s , i ∊ k ⇒ k = cdm s $ by ax
n3: $ G , k = cdm s , i ∊ k ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ by welc_eq [n2, n1]
n4: $ G , k = cdm s , i ∊ k ⇒ s ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
n5: $ G , k = cdm s , i ∊ k ⇒ fv (ssnoc s a) i = fv s i $ by ssnoc_fv_lt [n4, n3]
