s1: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ u ∀ v ∀ c ∀ d (u ∊ fseq A → v ∊ fseq A → cdm u = y → cdm v = y → nest u c = nest v d → u = v ∧ c = d) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ u ∀ v ∀ c ∀ d (u ∊ fseq A → v ∊ fseq A → cdm u = y → cdm v = y → nest u c = nest v d → u = v ∧ c = d) $ by ax
