c6: $ G , y ∊ esat u E T W , z ∊ ap (esf u E) T , ⟨ W , y ⟩ ∈ z , t = T ⇒ cdm (esf u E) = trees ω $ by weaken [a4]
c7: $ G , y ∊ esat u E T W , z ∊ ap (esf u E) T , ⟨ W , y ⟩ ∈ z , t = T ⇒ t ∊ trees ω $ by welc_eq [c6, c5]
c8: $ G , y ∊ esat u E T W , z ∊ ap (esf u E) T , ⟨ W , y ⟩ ∈ z , t = T ⇒ trees ω = ω × fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [a5]
