e1: $ G , c = ccom (esf u E) s , m = ⟨ w , p ⟩ , m ∊ esb u E k s c , (k = kc_nil ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals (csn ∅)) ∨ (k = kc_cons ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) o ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) o q ∧ r = scons x q)}) , k = kc_cons ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) o ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) o q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w q ∧ p = scons x q ⇒ q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w q ∧ p = scons x q $ by ax
e2: $ G , c = ccom (esf u E) s , m = ⟨ w , p ⟩ , m ∊ esb u E k s c , (k = kc_nil ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals (csn ∅)) ∨ (k = kc_cons ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) o ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) o q ∧ r = scons x q)}) , k = kc_cons ∧ m ∊ clam o lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) o ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) o q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w q ∧ p = scons x q ⇒ q ∊ ap (fv c (suc ∅)) w $ by and_elim_l [e1]
