m5: $ G , k = kc_pi , k ∊ ω , h = scons A (scons B ∅) , h ∊ fseq (trees ω) , c = ccom (etf u E) h ⇒ ap (clam o lvals (clam p (fseq u) {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv h ∅)) o p ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv c (suc ∅)) o (scons x p) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv c ∅) o p) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)})) w = clam p (fseq u) {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv h ∅)) w p ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv c (suc ∅)) w (scons x p) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv c ∅) w p) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by clam_ap [w0]
