a10: $ G , c = ccom (etf u E) s , m = ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , m ∊ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r ⇒ ap (etb u E k s c) w = ap (clam o lvals (clam p (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩))) w $ by ap_eq [a7, a8]
