a12: $ G , c = ccom (etf u E) s , m = ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , m ∊ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r ⇒ m ∊ ap (ap (clam o lvals (clam p (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩))) w) r $ by welc_eq [a11, a5]
a13: $ G , c = ccom (etf u E) s , m = ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , m ∊ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r ⇒ w ∊ lvals ∧ r ∊ fseq u ∧ m ∊ csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by c3_cc_mem [a12]
