lemma c3_pf_use {y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4: set} (G: hyps y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4) (E A R: class) (u w f g t a: set):
  $ G ⇒ A ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E A w R $ > $ G ⇒ isset R $ >
  $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $
----
l1: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} ⇒ e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ by ax
l2: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} ⇒ isset R $ by weaken [#3]
