m1: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V) $ by all_elim [m0]
m2: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ f , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → f ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm f ∧ cdm x3 = cdm f ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V) $ by all_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm x3 = cdm f ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V) $ by all_elim [m2]
m4: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ∀ x4 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V) $ by all_elim [m3]
m5: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by all_elim [m4]
n1: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ e = A $ by ax
n2: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ A = e $ by eq_sym [n1]
n3: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ (etf u E) = (etf u E) $ by eq_refl
n4: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ fv (etf u E) A = fv (etf u E) e $ by fv_eq [n3, n2]
n5: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
n6: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ q = R $ by ax
n7: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ R = q $ by eq_sym [n6]
n8: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ da (fv (etf u E) A) w R = da (fv (etf u E) e) w q $ by da_eq [n4, n5, n7]
n9: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E A w R $ by weaken [#2]
n10: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q $ by wcel_eq_r [n8, n9]
n11: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} , q = R ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by imp_elim [m5, n10]
n12: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by isset_elim [l3, n11]
n13: $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by wcel_elim [#1, n12]

lemma c3_pf_empty (G: hyps) (u f g t: set): $ G ⇒ f = ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ g = ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ t = ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq u $ by fseq_empty
l2: $ G ⇒ ∅ = f $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ f ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [l2, l1]
l4: $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ ∅ = g $ by eq_sym [#2]
l6: $ G ⇒ g ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [l5, l1]
l7: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ g = f $ by eq_trans [#2, l2]
l9: $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f $ by cdm_eq [l8]
l10: $ G ⇒ t = f $ by eq_trans [#3, l2]
l11: $ G ⇒ cdm t = cdm f $ by cdm_eq [l10]
l12: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq c3_V $ by fseq_empty
l13: $ G ⇒ ∅ = t $ by eq_sym [#3]
l14: $ G ⇒ t ∈ fseq c3_V $ by wcel_eq_l [l13, l12]
l15: $ G ⇒ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by wcel_welc [l14]
l16: $ G ⇒ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_intro [l11, l15]
l17: $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_intro [l9, l16]
l18: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_intro [l7, l17]
l19: $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_intro [l4, l18]

lemma c3_pf_step {y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4: set} (G: hyps y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4) (E: class) (u w k s r f0 g0 t0 a0: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r $ >
  $ G ⇒ f0 ∊ fseq u ∧ g0 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g0 = cdm f0 ∧ cdm t0 = cdm f0 ∧ t0 ∊ fseq c3_V $
----
p0: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ k = kc_pi $ by ax
p0a: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
p0b: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
p0c: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r $ by weaken [#4]
p1: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a) $ by c3_etel_dpi [p0, p0a, p0b, p0c]
