c0: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a ⇒ x ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [i0]
d0: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a $ by and_elim_r [i0]
c1: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) $ by and_elim_l [d0]
