h2: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a ⇒ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ by wcel_subset [h1, c2]
