lemma c3_pf_node {y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4: set} (G: hyps y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4) (E: class) (u w k s: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $
----
