n8: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)}) $ by all_intro [n7]
n9: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)}) $ by all_intro [n8]
n10: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
n11: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ by trees_ind_c [n10, n9]
n12: $ G ⇒ T ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x1 ∊ fseq u ∧ x2 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x2 = cdm x1 ∧ cdm x3 = cdm x1 ∧ x3 ∊ fseq c3_V)} $ by wcel_subset [n11, #1]
n13: $ G ⇒ isset r $ by isset_var
n14: $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by c3_pf_use [n12, #2, n13]
n15: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_elim_r [n14]
n16: $ G ⇒ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f ∧ t ∊ fseq c3_V $ by and_elim_r [n15]
