m2: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w x5 → cdm f = cdm x6) $ by all_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w x5 → cdm f = cdm x6) $ by all_elim [m2]
m4: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w x5 → cdm f = cdm x6) $ by all_elim [m3]
m5: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w x5 → cdm f = cdm x6) $ by all_elim [m4]
