m7: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ f2 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w o → cdm f = cdm f2) $ by all_elim [m6]
m8: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w o → cdm f = cdm f2) $ by all_elim [m7]
m9: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ∀ x9 (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w o → cdm f = cdm f2) $ by all_elim [m8]
m10: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w q → ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E e w o → cdm f = cdm f2 $ by all_elim [m9]
n1: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ e = A $ by ax
n2: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ A = e $ by eq_sym [n1]
n3: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ (etf u E) = (etf u E) $ by eq_refl
n4: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ fv (etf u E) A = fv (etf u E) e $ by fv_eq [n3, n2]
n5: $ G , e = A , e ∊ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} , q = R , o = R2 ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
