m1: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a , b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons b r2) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f2 = ssnoc d b ∧ g2 = scons b e ∧ t2 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r2) h ∧ a2 = l ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $ by weaken [#3]
