q5: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r) a , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r2 ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f2 = ∅ ∧ g2 = ∅ ∧ t2 = ∅ ∧ a2 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r2) d ⇒ ∅ = f2 $ by eq_sym [qk2]
q6: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r) a , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r2 ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f2 = ∅ ∧ g2 = ∅ ∧ t2 = ∅ ∧ a2 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r2) d ⇒ f0 = f2 $ by eq_trans [qj2, q5]
q7: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r) a , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r2 ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f2 = ∅ ∧ g2 = ∅ ∧ t2 = ∅ ∧ a2 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r2) d ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by cdm_eq [q6]
q2w: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r) a ⇒ ∃ d (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r2 ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f2 = ∅ ∧ g2 = ∅ ∧ t2 = ∅ ∧ a2 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r2) d) $ by weaken [q2]
q8: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s ∅) w r ∧ fv s ∅ ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = scons (da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r) a ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by ex_elim [q2w, q7]
q9: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_app ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by ex_elim [q1, q8]
con1: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_pi ⇒ k = kc_pi $ by ax
con2: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_pi ⇒ k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app $ by or_intro_l [con1]
con3: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_pi ⇒ ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) $ by ax
con4: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_pi ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [con3, con2]
con5: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ ¬ k = kc_pi $ by not_intro [con4]
con6: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_app ⇒ k = kc_app $ by ax
con7: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_app ⇒ k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app $ by or_intro_r [con6]
con8: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_app ⇒ ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) $ by ax
con9: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) , k = kc_app ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [con8, con7]
con10: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ ¬ k = kc_app $ by not_intro [con9]
r0a: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
r0b: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
r0c: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r $ by weaken [#4]
r0d: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r2 $ by weaken [#5]
r1: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ f0 = ∅ ∧ g0 = ∅ ∧ t0 = ∅ ∧ a0 = ∅ $ by c3_etel_doth [con5, con10, r0a, r0b, r0c]
r2: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ f2 = ∅ ∧ g2 = ∅ ∧ t2 = ∅ ∧ a2 = ∅ $ by c3_etel_doth [con5, con10, r0a, r0b, r0d]
r3: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ f0 = ∅ $ by and_elim_l [r1]
r4: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ f2 = ∅ $ by and_elim_l [r2]
r5: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ ∅ = f2 $ by eq_sym [r4]
r6: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ f0 = f2 $ by eq_trans [r3, r5]
r7: $ G , ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by cdm_eq [r6]
cs1: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app ⇒ k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app $ by ax
cs2: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by or_elim [cs1, xd9, q9]
cs3: $ G ⇒ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) ∨ ¬ (k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app) $ by excluded_middle
cs4: $ G ⇒ cdm f0 = cdm f2 $ by or_elim [cs3, cs2, r7]

lemma c3_el_node {y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 x9: set} (G: hyps y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 x9) (E: class) (u w k s: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $
----
a1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by ax
a2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ (etf u E) = (etf u E) $ by eq_refl
a3: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ fv (etf u E) z = fv (etf u E) ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by fv_eq [a2, a1]
a4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
b0a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ b = b $ by eq_refl
b0b: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ da (fv (etf u E) z) w b = da (fv (etf u E) ⟨ k , s ⟩) w b $ by da_eq [a3, a4, b0a]
b0c: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b $ by ax
b0d: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w b $ by wcel_eq_r [b0b, b0c]
b1a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ m = m $ by eq_refl
b1b: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ da (fv (etf u E) z) w m = da (fv (etf u E) ⟨ k , s ⟩) w m $ by da_eq [a3, a4, b1a]
b1c: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m $ by ax
b1d: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w m $ by wcel_eq_r [b1b, b1c]
a9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
a10: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
a11: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $ by weaken [#3]
a12: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b , ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m ⇒ cdm d = cdm n $ by c3_el_step [a9, a10, a11, b0d, b1d]
c1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b ⇒ ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n $ by imp_intro [a12]
c0: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n $ by imp_intro [c1]
d9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [c0]
d8: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [d9]
d7: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ o ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [d8]
d6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ n ∀ o ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [d7]
d5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ m ∀ n ∀ o ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [d6]
d4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ∀ l ∀ m ∀ n ∀ o ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w b → ⟨ n , ⟨ o , ⟨ p , q ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E z w m → cdm d = cdm n) $ by all_intro [d5]
