n5: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $ by imp_intro [n4]
n6: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x5 → cdm x1 = cdm x6)} $ by imp_intro [n5]
