lemma c3_ed_step {y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x6 x7 x8: set} (G: hyps y x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x6 x7 x8) (E: class) (u w k s r f0 g0 t0 a0 g2 t2 a2: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8)} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ t0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ k , s ⟩ w r $ >
  $ G ⇒ g0 = g2 ∧ t0 = t2 ∧ a0 = a2 $
----
cp0: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ k = kc_pi $ by ax
p0a: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
p0b: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
