m10a: $ G , k = kc_pi ∨ k = kc_app , k = kc_pi , x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc f x ∧ g0 = scons x g ∧ t0 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) t ∧ a0 = a , b ∊ u ∧ ⟨ d , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E (fv s (suc ∅)) w (scons b r) ∧ fv s (suc ∅) ∈ crn s ∧ f0 = ssnoc d b ∧ g2 = scons b e ∧ t2 = scons (etel u E (fv s ∅) w r) h ∧ a2 = l ⇒ ssnoc f x = f0 $ by eq_sym [j3]
