n8: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8)}) $ by all_intro [n7]
n9: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8)} → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ {y | ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E y w x0 → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8)}) $ by all_intro [n8]
n10: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
