lemma c3_eagr_idx (G: hyps) (E E2 I: class) (k s: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ isset I $ >
  $ G ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $
----
a1: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ functional tsub $ by tsub_functional
a2: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ cdm tsub = trees ω $ by tsub_cdm
a3: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
a4: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ I ∈ cdm s $ by ax
a5: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ fv (ccom tsub s) I = fv tsub (fv s I) ∧ fv s I ∈ crn s $ by c3_child [a1, a2, a3, a4]
a6: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ fv s I ∈ crn s $ by and_elim_r [a5]
b1: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ b ∊ crn s $ by ax
b2: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
b3: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
b4: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ b ∈ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by tsub_crn [b2, b3, b1]
b5: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ b ∊ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by wcel_welc [b4]
b6: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ eagr E E2 ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by weaken [#3]
b7: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv E b = fv E2 b $ by eagr_at [b6, b5]
b8: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ b = fv s I $ by ax
b9: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv s I = b $ by eq_sym [b8]
b10: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ E = E $ by eq_refl
b11: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ E2 = E2 $ by eq_refl
b12: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E b $ by fv_eq [b10, b9]
b13: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv E2 b = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by fv_eq [b11, b8]
b14: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 b $ by eq_trans [b12, b7]
b15: $ G , I ∈ cdm s , b = fv s I , b ∊ crn s ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by eq_trans [b14, b13]
b16: $ G , I ∈ cdm s ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by wcel_elim [a6, b15]
c1: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I , i ∊ cdm s ⇒ i ∊ cdm s $ by ax
c2: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I , i ∊ cdm s ⇒ i = I $ by ax
c3: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I , i ∊ cdm s ⇒ I ∈ cdm s $ by wcel_intro [c2, c1]
c4: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I , i ∊ cdm s ⇒ ¬ I ∈ cdm s $ by ax
c5: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I , i ∊ cdm s ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [c4, c3]
c6: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ i ∊ cdm s → ⊥ $ by imp_intro [c5]
c7: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv s i = ∅ $ by fv_empty [c6]
c8: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ i = I $ by ax
c9: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ I = i $ by eq_sym [c8]
c10: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ s = s $ by eq_refl
c11: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv s I = fv s i $ by fv_eq [c10, c9]
c12: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv s I = ∅ $ by eq_trans [c11, c7]
c13: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ E = E $ by eq_refl
c14: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ E2 = E2 $ by eq_refl
c15: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E ∅ $ by fv_eq [c13, c12]
c16: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ ∅ = fv s I $ by eq_sym [c12]
c17: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv E2 ∅ = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by fv_eq [c14, c16]
c18: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ eagr E E2 ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by weaken [#3]
c19: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv E ∅ = fv E2 ∅ $ by and_elim_l [c18]
c20: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 ∅ $ by eq_trans [c15, c19]
c21: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s , i = I ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by eq_trans [c20, c17]
c22a: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s ⇒ isset I $ by weaken [#4]
c22: $ G , ¬ I ∈ cdm s ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by isset_elim [c22a, c21]
d1: $ G ⇒ I ∈ cdm s ∨ ¬ I ∈ cdm s $ by excluded_middle
d2: $ G ⇒ fv E (fv s I) = fv E2 (fv s I) $ by or_elim [d1, b16, c22]

lemma c3_et_node {x9: set} (G: hyps x9) (E E2: class) (u k s: set):
  $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ {x9 | eagr E E2 x9 → fv (etf u E) x9 = fv (etf u E2) x9} $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ {x9 | eagr E E2 x9 → fv (etf u E) x9 = fv (etf u E2) x9} $
----
a0a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
a0b: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
a1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by ax
a2o: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
a2k: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ k ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [a0a]
a2h: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ s ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by welc_wcel [a0b]
a2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by trees_intro_c [a2o, a2k, a2h]
a3: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by tsub_self [a2]
a4a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ tsub = tsub $ by eq_refl
a4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ fv tsub z = fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by fv_eq [a4a, a1]
a5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv tsub z $ by eq_sym [a4]
a6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ fv tsub z $ by wcel_eq_r [a5, a3]
a7: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ eagr E E2 z $ by ax
a8: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z ⇒ eagr E E2 ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by eagr_sub [a7, a6]
y0: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ y ∊ crn s $ by ax
y0a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by weaken [#1]
y0b: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#2]
y1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ y ∈ fv tsub ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by tsub_crn [y0a, y0b, y0]
y2a: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ eagr E E2 ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by weaken [a8]
y2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , eagr E E2 z , y ∊ crn s ⇒ eagr E E2 y $ by eagr_sub [y2a, y1]
