ha1: $ G , ∃ x0 ∃ r ∃ x1 ∃ w ∃ x2 (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x0 (scons x1 (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ∧ l = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ g = q ∧ d = r ∧ ra_nth_ty w x2 q r ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ r ∃ x1 ∃ w ∃ x2 (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x0 (scons x1 (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ∧ l = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ g = q ∧ d = r ∧ ra_nth_ty w x2 q r ∈ lrel) $ by ax
