u1: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x0 (scons x1 (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ∧ l = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ g = q ∧ d = r ∧ ra_nth_ty w x2 q r ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ x ∀ i ∀ k (ra_nth_ty x i f c ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty x k g d ∈ lrel → fv nvf i = fv nvf k → suc (fv nvf i) = fv nvf j → f = g ∧ c = d) $ by weaken [#8]
