a1: $ G ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ e (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons e ∅)) ⟩ ∧ j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ c = b) ∨ ∃ a ∃ u ∃ b ∃ v ∃ e ∃ h (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons u (scons v (scons e ∅)) ⟩ ∧ j = ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ c = b ∧ ra_nth_ty e h a b ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_nth_ty_cases [#1]
