qq1: $ G , q = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x0 (scons e ∅) ⟩ ∧ l = ⟨ kc_s , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ g = r ∧ ra_nth_ctor e x1 r ∈ lrel ⇒ l = ⟨ kc_s , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [qqr0]
