qq1: $ G , q = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons u (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ j = ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∧ k = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor b h a ∈ lrel ⇒ j = ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [qqr0]
qqr1: $ G , q = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons u (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ j = ⟨ kc_s , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∧ k = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor b h a ∈ lrel ⇒ k = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor b h a ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [qqr0]
