o2: $ G , v = ⟨ R , y ⟩ , v ∊ ap (fv (etf u E) o) W , q = ⟨ W , v ⟩ , q ∊ fv (etf u E) o , ∃ c (q = ⟨ a , ⟨ b , c ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ isset W ∧ isset R $ by ex_elim [o1, h19]
o3: $ G , v = ⟨ R , y ⟩ , v ∊ ap (fv (etf u E) o) W , q = ⟨ W , v ⟩ , q ∊ fv (etf u E) o , ∃ b ∃ c (q = ⟨ a , ⟨ b , c ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ b ∃ c (q = ⟨ a , ⟨ b , c ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
o4: $ G , v = ⟨ R , y ⟩ , v ∊ ap (fv (etf u E) o) W , q = ⟨ W , v ⟩ , q ∊ fv (etf u E) o , ∃ b ∃ c (q = ⟨ a , ⟨ b , c ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ isset W ∧ isset R $ by ex_elim [o3, o2]
