--| The fields of a path are a sequence over `u`, at any level valuation and arguments.
lemma c5_etel_g (G: hyps) (E W R: class) (u o f g t a: set):
  $ G ⇒ o ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W R $ > $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $
----
k0: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ y ∊ etel u E o W R $ by ax
k4: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ o ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
k1: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ isset W ∧ isset R $ by etel_isset [k4, k0]
k2: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ isset W $ by and_elim_l [k1]
k3: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ isset R $ by and_elim_r [k1]
k5: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W ⇒ isset R $ by weaken [k3]
m1: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ fv (etf u E) o = fv (etf u E) o $ by eq_refl
m0: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ w = W $ by ax
m2: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ W = w $ by eq_sym [m0]
n0: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ r = R $ by ax
m3: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ R = r $ by eq_sym [n0]
m4: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ etel u E o W R = etel u E o w r $ by da_eq [m1, m2, m3]
m5: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W R $ by weaken [#2]
m6: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w r $ by wcel_eq_r [m4, m5]
n1: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ o ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
m7: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ o ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [n1]
m8: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by etel_fseq [m7, m6]
m9: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by and_elim_r [m8]
m10: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W , r = R ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [m9]
m11: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R , w = W ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by isset_elim [k5, m10]
m12: $ G , y = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , y ∊ etel u E o W R ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by isset_elim [k2, m11]
m13: $ G ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_elim [#2, m12]

--| A constructor's type is a tree.
