x5: $ G , iprt D p t ∧ fv nvf n = j ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [x4]
x6: $ G , iprt D p t ∧ fv nvf n = j ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel ⇒ kr_nth_ctor ∈ ω $ by kr_nth_ctor_omega
x7: $ G , iprt D p t ∧ fv nvf n = j ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel ⇒ isset kr_nth_ctor $ by wcel_isset [x6]
