n5: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ eagr E E2 q $ by eagr_sub [n2, n4]
n6: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ fv tsub D ⊆ trees ω $ by tsub_trees
n7: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ q ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [n6, n4]
n8: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ esat u E q W = esat u E2 q W $ by esat_local [n7, n5]
