n11: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ eagr E E2 k $ by eagr_sub [n2, n10]
n12: $ G , ¬ iprop D J W , iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D J C k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons C g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ k ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [n6, n10]
