e1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ , ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ , ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ y = z $ by ex_elim [e1, d27]
e3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ax
e4a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ j (o = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [e3]
e4b: $ ∃ j (o = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_alpha
e4c: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ j (o = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) ↔ ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) $ by weaken [e4b]
e4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ l (o = ⟨ l , ⟨ l , ient D W Z l ⟩ ⟩) $ by bi_elim_l [e4c, e4a]
e5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y = z $ by cut [e4, e2]
e6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
e7: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ y = z $ by ex_elim [e6, e5]
e8: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ax
e9a: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ∃ j (v = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [e8]
e9b: $ ∃ j (v = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_alpha
e9c: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ∃ j (v = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) ↔ ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) $ by weaken [e9b]
e9: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ∃ i (v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩) $ by bi_elim_l [e9c, e9a]
e10: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , o = ⟨ x , z ⟩ , o ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ y = z $ by cut [e9, e7]
e11: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ax
e12: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ y = z $ by wcel_elim [e11, e10]
e13: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ax
e14: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ y = z $ by wcel_elim [e13, e12]
e15: $ G ⇒ functional {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by functional_intro [e14]

lemma c6_ixs_img {j w: set} (G: hyps) (D W Z: class): $ G ⇒ ixs D W Z ⊆ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $
----
k1: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ $ by ax
k2: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ $ by ax
k3: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k2]
k4: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
k5: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , z ⟩ = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [k4, k3]
k6: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ i , ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [k1, k5]
k7: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ ∃ j (v = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [k6]
k8: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by cab_intro [k7]
k9: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ v ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by welc_wcel [k8]
k10: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , z ⟩ ∈ {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by wcel_eq_l [k1, k9]
k11: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [k2]
k12: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ , v = ⟨ i , z ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by img_intro [k11, k10]
k13: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ i , z ⟩ $ by opair_isset
k14: $ G , i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by isset_elim [k13, k12]
k15: $ G , ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) $ by ax
k16: $ G , ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by ex_elim [k15, k14]
k17: $ G , z ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩)} $ by ax
k18: $ G , z ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) $ by cab_elim [k17]
k19: $ G , z ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ z ∊ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by cut [k18, k16]
k20: $ G ⇒ ixs D W Z ⊆ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by subset_intro [k19]

ixs_set
-------
l1: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2: $ G ⇒ intys D ⊆ ω $ by intys_sub
l3: $ G ⇒ isset (intys D) $ by subset_isset [l1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ functional {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} $ by c6_ix_fun
l5: $ G ⇒ isset (img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D)) $ by img_set [l4, l3]
l6: $ G ⇒ ixs D W Z ⊆ img {w | ∃ j (w = ⟨ j , ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⟩)} (intys D) $ by c6_ixs_img
l7: $ G ⇒ isset (ixs D W Z) $ by subset_isset [l5, l6]

lemma c6_ixs_cdm (G: hyps) (D W Z: class): $ G ⇒ cdm (ixs D W Z) ⊆ ω $
----
m1: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by ax
m2: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [m2]
m4: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = v $ by eq_sym [m1]
m5: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m4, m3]
m6: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ isset i $ by isset_var
m6x: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
m7: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ x = i $ by opair_inj_l_c [m5, m6x, m6]
m8: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [m2]
m9: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ intys D ⊆ ω $ by intys_sub
m10: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by subset_elim [m9, m8]
m11: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ i = x $ by eq_sym [m7]
m12: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by welc_eq_set [m11, m10]
n1: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) $ by ax
n2: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by ex_elim [n1, m12]
n3: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ v ∊ {z | ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ z = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩)} $ by ax
n4: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ intys D ∧ v = ⟨ i , ient D W Z i ⟩) $ by cab_elim [n3]
n5: $ G , v = ⟨ x , y ⟩ , v ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by cut [n4, n2]
n6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z $ by ax
n7: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by wcel_elim [n6, n5]
n8: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ixs D W Z) ⇒ x ∊ cdm (ixs D W Z) $ by ax
n9: $ G , x ∊ cdm (ixs D W Z) ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by cdm_elim [n8, n7]
n10: $ G ⇒ cdm (ixs D W Z) ⊆ ω $ by subset_intro [n9]

lemma c6_R_set (G: hyps) (A D W Z: class) (p: set): $ G ⇒ p ∊ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ isset (scat p (ixs D W Z)) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ isset (ixs D W Z) $ by ixs_set
l2: $ G ⇒ cdm (ixs D W Z) ⊆ ω $ by c6_ixs_cdm
l3: $ G ⇒ isset (scat p (ixs D W Z)) $ by scat_set [#1, l1, l2]

lemma c6_ictor_intro (G: hyps) (E D W: class) (u j c p q e k f g t a y: set): $ G ⇒ ¬ iprop D j W $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D q e $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W $ > $ G ⇒ ictk D j c k $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ > $ G ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ > $ G ⇒ nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W $
----
i1: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by ax
i2: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by weaken [#6]
i3: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ y ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by and_intro [i2, i1]
i4: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by weaken [#5]
i5: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by and_intro [i4, i3]
i6: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ictk D j c k $ by weaken [#4]
i7: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by and_intro [i6, i5]
i8: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W $ by weaken [#3]
i9: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by and_intro [i8, i7]
i10: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ iprt D q e $ by weaken [#2]
i11: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ y ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) y $ by and_intro [i10, i9]
x1: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) x8) $ by ex_intro [i11]
x2: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x1]
x3: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c g ∧ z = nest (scat f p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x2]
x4: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat f p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x3]
x5: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x4]
x6: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x5]
x7: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D q x2 ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x6]
x8: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ p ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 p) x8) $ by ex_intro [x7]
x9: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by ex_intro [x8]
x10: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ¬ iprop D j W $ by weaken [#1]
x11: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ ¬ iprop D j W ∧ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by and_intro [x10, x9]
x12: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ z ∊ {z | ¬ iprop D j W ∧ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8)} $ by cab_intro [x11]
x13: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ z ∊ ictor u E D j c W $ by weaken [x12]
x14: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ z ∈ ictor u E D j c W $ by welc_wcel [x13]
x15: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y ⇒ nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W $ by wcel_eq_l [i1, x14]
x16: $ G ⇒ isset (nest (scat f p) y) $ by nest_set
x17: $ G ⇒ nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W $ by isset_elim [x16, x15]

lemma c6_esat_w (G: hyps) (E T W: class) (u p w: set): $ G ⇒ w = W $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ esat u E T W $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ esat u E T w $
----
h1: $ G ⇒ W = w $ by eq_sym [#1]
h2: $ G ⇒ fv (esf u E) T = fv (esf u E) T $ by eq_refl
h3: $ G ⇒ esat u E T W = esat u E T w $ by ap_eq [h2, h1]
h4: $ G ⇒ p ∊ esat u E T w $ by welc_eq [h3, #2]

lemma c6_etel_w (G: hyps) (E T W R: class) (u f g t a w: set): $ G ⇒ w = W $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w R $
----
h1: $ G ⇒ W = w $ by eq_sym [#1]
h2: $ G ⇒ fv (etf u E) T = fv (etf u E) T $ by eq_refl
h3: $ G ⇒ R = R $ by eq_refl
h4: $ G ⇒ etel u E T W R = etel u E T w R $ by da_eq [h2, h1, h3]
h5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w R $ by wcel_eq_r [h4, #2]

esat_len_c
----------
h1: $ G , w = W ⇒ w = W $ by ax
h2: $ G , w = W ⇒ p ∊ esat u E T W $ by weaken [#3]
h3: $ G , w = W ⇒ q ∊ esat u E T W $ by weaken [#4]
h4: $ G , w = W ⇒ p ∊ esat u E T w $ by c6_esat_w [h1, h2]
h5: $ G , w = W ⇒ q ∊ esat u E T w $ by c6_esat_w [h1, h3]
h6: $ G , w = W ⇒ T ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
h7: $ G , w = W ⇒ cdm p = cdm q $ by esat_len [h6, h4, h5]
h8: $ G ⇒ cdm p = cdm q $ by isset_elim [#1, h7]

etel_fseq_c
-----------
h1: $ G , w = W ⇒ w = W $ by ax
h2: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W r $ by weaken [#3]
h3: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w r $ by c6_etel_w [h1, h2]
h4: $ G , w = W ⇒ T ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
h5: $ G , w = W ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by etel_fseq [h4, h3]
h6: $ G ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by isset_elim [#1, h5]

etel_len_c
----------
h1: $ G , w = W ⇒ w = W $ by ax
h2: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W r $ by weaken [#3]
h3: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w r $ by c6_etel_w [h1, h2]
h4: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W r $ by weaken [#4]
h5: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w r $ by c6_etel_w [h1, h4]
h6: $ G , w = W ⇒ T ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
h7: $ G , w = W ⇒ cdm f = cdm f2 $ by etel_len [h6, h3, h5]
h8: $ G ⇒ cdm f = cdm f2 $ by isset_elim [#1, h7]

etel_det_c
----------
h1: $ G , w = W ⇒ w = W $ by ax
h2: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W r $ by weaken [#3]
h3: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w r $ by c6_etel_w [h1, h2]
h4: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W r $ by weaken [#4]
h5: $ G , w = W ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T w r $ by c6_etel_w [h1, h4]
h6: $ G , w = W ⇒ T ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
h7: $ G , w = W ⇒ g = g2 ∧ t = t2 ∧ a = a2 $ by etel_det [h6, h3, h5]
h8: $ G ⇒ g = g2 ∧ t = t2 ∧ a = a2 $ by isset_elim [#1, h7]

lemma c6_apn_in (G: hyps) (E D W: class) (u j c p f g t a q e k x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 y: set): $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D q e $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W $ > $ G ⇒ ictk D j c k $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D x1 x2 $ > $ G ⇒ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W $ > $ G ⇒ ictk D j c x3 $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ > $ G ⇒ x8 ∊ scons c x5 $ > $ G ⇒ nest (scat f p) y = nest (scat x4 x0) x8 $ > $ G ⇒ isset W $ > $ G ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ q ∈ fv tsub D ∧ e ∈ fv tsub D $ by iprt_tsub [#1, #2]
a2: $ G ⇒ q ∈ fv tsub D $ by and_elim_l [a1]
a3: $ G ⇒ fv tsub D ⊆ trees ω $ by tsub_trees
a4: $ G ⇒ q ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [a3, a2]
a5: $ G ⇒ k ∈ fv tsub D $ by ictk_tsub [#1, #4]
a6: $ G ⇒ k ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [a3, a5]
a7: $ G ⇒ q = x1 ∧ e = x2 $ by iprt_det [#2, #6]
a8: $ G ⇒ q = x1 $ by and_elim_l [a7]
a9: $ G ⇒ x1 = q $ by eq_sym [a8]
a10: $ G ⇒ x0 ∊ esat u E q W $ by eq_subst [a9, #7]
a11: $ G ⇒ k = x3 $ by ictk_det [#4, #8]
a12: $ G ⇒ x3 = k $ by eq_sym [a11]
a13: $ G ⇒ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by eq_subst [a12, #9]
a14: $ G ⇒ esat u E q W ⊆ fseq u $ by esat_fseq
a15: $ G ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ by subset_elim [a14, #3]
a16: $ G ⇒ x0 ∊ fseq u $ by subset_elim [a14, a10]
a17: $ G ⇒ cdm p = cdm x0 $ by esat_len_c [#12, a4, #3, a10]
a18: $ G ⇒ isset (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by c6_R_set [a15]
a19: $ G ⇒ isset (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by c6_R_set [a16]
b1: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) $ by ax
b2: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) = r $ by eq_sym [b1]
b3: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ fv (etf u E) k = fv (etf u E) k $ by eq_refl
b4: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
b5: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E k W r $ by da_eq [b3, b4, b2]
b6: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by weaken [#5]
b7: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W r $ by wcel_eq_r [b5, b6]
b8: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ k ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [a6]
b8w: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ isset W $ by weaken [#12]
b9: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by etel_fseq_c [b8w, b8, b7]
b10: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ f ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [b9]
b11: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) $ by ax
b12: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) = m $ by eq_sym [b11]
b13: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ etel u E k W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E k W m $ by da_eq [b3, b4, b12]
b14: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by weaken [a13]
b15: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W m $ by wcel_eq_r [b13, b14]
b16: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ x4 ∊ fseq u ∧ x5 ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm x5 = cdm x4 ∧ cdm x6 = cdm x4 $ by etel_fseq_c [b8w, b8, b15]
b17: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ x4 ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [b16]
b18: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
b19: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [a15]
b20: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ nest (scat f p) y = nest p (nest f y) $ by nest_scat [b10, b19, b18]
b21: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ isset x8 $ by isset_var
b22: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ x0 ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [a16]
b23: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ nest (scat x4 x0) x8 = nest x0 (nest x4 x8) $ by nest_scat [b17, b22, b21]
b24: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ nest p (nest f y) = nest (scat f p) y $ by eq_sym [b20]
b25: $ G , r = scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) , m = scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) ⇒ nest (scat f p) y = nest (scat x4 x0) x8 $ by weaken [#11]
