v10: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ex_elim [v9, v8]
v11: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by ax
v12: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ex_elim [v11, v10]
v13: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by ax
v14: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ex_elim [v13, v12]
v15: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by ax
v16: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ex_elim [v15, v14]
v17: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by ax
v18: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ex_elim [v17, v16]
v19: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , z ∊ ictor u E D j c W ⇒ z ∊ {z | ¬ iprop D j W ∧ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8)} $ by ax
v20: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , z ∊ ictor u E D j c W ⇒ ¬ iprop D j W ∧ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by cab_elim [v19]
v21: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , z ∊ ictor u E D j c W ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (iprt D x1 x2 ∧ x0 ∊ esat u E x1 W ∧ ictk D j c x3 ∧ ⟨ x4 , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , x7 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 W (scat x0 (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ x8 ∊ scons c x5 ∧ z = nest (scat x4 x0) x8) $ by and_elim_r [v20]
v22: $ G , z = nest (scat f p) y , z ∊ ictor u E D j c W ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by cut [v21, v18]
v23: $ G , y ∊ apn (ictor u E D j c W) (scat f p) ⇒ y ∊ {y | nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W} $ by ax
v24: $ G , y ∊ apn (ictor u E D j c W) (scat f p) ⇒ nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W $ by cab_elim [v23]
v25: $ G , y ∊ apn (ictor u E D j c W) (scat f p) ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by wcel_elim [v24, v22]
u1: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ ¬ iprop D j W $ by weaken [#2]
u2: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ iprt D q e $ by weaken [#3]
u3: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W $ by weaken [#4]
u4: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ ictk D j c k $ by weaken [#5]
u5: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by weaken [#6]
u6: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ y ∊ scons c g $ by ax
u7: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W $ by c6_ictor_intro [u1, u2, u3, u4, u5, u6]
u8: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ y ∊ {y | nest (scat f p) y ∈ ictor u E D j c W} $ by cab_intro [u7]
u9: $ G , y ∊ scons c g ⇒ y ∊ apn (ictor u E D j c W) (scat f p) $ by weaken [u8]
u10: $ G ⇒ apn (ictor u E D j c W) (scat f p) = scons c g $ by eq_intro [v25, u9]

lemma c6_esb_sub {w: set} (G: hyps) (E K S V: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ esb u E K S V ⊆ clam w lvals (fseq u) $
----
q1: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ d ∊ csn ∅ $ by ax
q2: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ d = ∅ $ by csn_elim [q1]
q3: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq u $ by fseq_empty
q4: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ ∅ = d $ by eq_sym [q2]
q5: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ d ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [q4, q3]
q6: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ d ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [q5]
q7: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ b ∊ lvals $ by ax
q8: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ ⟨ b , d ⟩ ∈ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by clam_intro [q7, q6]
q9: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ $ by ax
q10: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ ⟨ b , d ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [q9]
q11: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ z ∈ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by wcel_eq_l [q10, q8]
q12: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ csn ∅ ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by wcel_welc [q11]
c1: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅) ⇒ K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅) $ by ax
c2: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅) ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅) $ by and_elim_r [c1]
c3: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅) ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by clam_elim_mem [c2, q12]
r1: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} $ by ax
r2: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ d ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ d = scons x q) $ by cab_elim [r1]
r3: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ d ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [r2]
r4: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ b ∊ lvals $ by ax
r5: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ ⟨ b , d ⟩ ∈ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by clam_intro [r4, r3]
r6: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ $ by ax
r7: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ ⟨ b , d ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [r6]
r8: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z ∈ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by wcel_eq_l [r7, r5]
r9: $ G , z = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ lvals , d ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) b ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) b q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by wcel_welc [r8]
c4: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} $ by ax
c5: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} $ by and_elim_r [c4]
c6: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V , K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by clam_elim_mem [c5, r9]
c7: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V ⇒ z ∊ {z | (K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅)) ∨ (K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)})} $ by ax
c8: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V ⇒ (K = kc_nil ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals (csn ∅)) ∨ (K = kc_cons ∧ z ∊ clam w lvals {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ ap (fv V (suc ∅)) w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E (fv S ∅)) w q ∧ r = scons x q)}) $ by cab_elim [c7]
c9: $ G , z ∊ esb u E K S V ⇒ z ∊ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by or_elim [c8, c3, c6]
c10: $ G ⇒ esb u E K S V ⊆ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by subset_intro [c9]

lemma c6_esb_set (G: hyps) (E K S V: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ isset (esb u E K S V) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ isset lvals $ by lvals_set
l2: $ G , w ∊ lvals ⇒ isset u $ by isset_var
l3: $ G , w ∊ lvals ⇒ isset (fseq u) $ by fseq_set [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals → isset (fseq u) $ by imp_intro [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → isset (fseq u)) $ by all_intro [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ isset (clam w lvals (fseq u)) $ by clam_set [l1, l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ esb u E K S V ⊆ clam w lvals (fseq u) $ by c6_esb_sub
l8: $ G ⇒ isset (esb u E K S V) $ by subset_isset [l6, l7]

lemma c6_clam_isset {w: set} (G: hyps) (A B W: class) (p: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ W , p ⟩ ∈ clam w A B $ > $ G ⇒ isset W $
----
m1: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B , x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ A , d ∊ B ⇒ x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ $ by ax
m2: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B , x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ A , d ∊ B ⇒ x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B , x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ A , d ∊ B ⇒ ⟨ W , p ⟩ = x0 $ by eq_sym [m1]
m4: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B , x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ A , d ∊ B ⇒ ⟨ W , p ⟩ = ⟨ b , d ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m3, m2]
m5: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B , x0 = ⟨ b , d ⟩ , b ∊ A , d ∊ B ⇒ isset W $ by opair_eq_isset [m4]
m6: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B ⇒ x0 ∊ clam w A B $ by ax
m7: $ G , x0 = ⟨ W , p ⟩ , x0 ∊ clam w A B ⇒ isset W $ by clam_elim_mem [m6, m5]
m8: $ G ⇒ isset W $ by wcel_elim [#1, m7]

esat_isset
----------
e1: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ $ by ax
e2: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ i ∊ o $ by and_elim_l [e1]
e3: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [e1]
e4: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ n ∊ fseq (trees o) $ by and_elim_l [e3]
e5: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [e3]
e6: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ o = ω $ by ax
e7: $ G , o = ω , m = T , i ∊ o ∧ n ∊ fseq (trees o) ∧ m = ⟨ i , n ⟩ , c = ccom (esf u E) n ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by welc_eq [e6, e2]
