eb2: $ G , ∃ e ∃ j ∃ c ∃ k ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E k W (scat p (ixs D W Z)) ∧ a ∊ fseq u ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ iop0 u E D2 W2 Z2 $ by ex_elim [ea2, eb3]
