y22: $ G , h = ifam u E D W , h ∊ v ∧ u ∊ v ∧ universe v ⇒ isset (ity u E D J W) $ by wcel_isset [y21]
y23: $ G , h = ifam u E D W , ∃ v (h ∊ v ∧ u ∊ v ∧ universe v) ⇒ ∃ v (h ∊ v ∧ u ∊ v ∧ universe v) $ by ax
y24: $ G , h = ifam u E D W , ∃ v (h ∊ v ∧ u ∊ v ∧ universe v) ⇒ isset (ity u E D J W) $ by ex_elim [y23, y22]
y25: $ G , h = ifam u E D W ⇒ ∃ v (h ∊ v ∧ u ∊ v ∧ universe v) $ by universe_common
