a1: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ x ∊ ityv U E D J W $ by ax
a2: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ igate U E D J W ∧ x ∈ ity U E D J W $ by cab_elim [a1]
a3: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ igate U E D J W $ by and_elim_l [a2]
a4: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ x ∈ ity U E D J W $ by and_elim_r [a2]
a5: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ igate U E D J W → igate U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by weaken [#1]
a6: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ igate U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by imp_elim [a5, a3]
a7: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ ity U E D J W = ity U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by weaken [#2]
a8: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ x ∈ ity U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by wcel_eq_r [a7, a4]
a9: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ igate U E2 D2 J2 W2 ∧ x ∈ ity U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by and_intro [a6, a8]
a10: $ G , x ∊ ityv U E D J W ⇒ x ∊ ityv U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by cab_intro [a9]
a11: $ G ⇒ ityv U E D J W ⊆ ityv U E2 D2 J2 W2 $ by subset_intro [a10]

