y2: $ G , ∃ t ∃ f (iprt D p t ∧ ityf D J f ∧ ity u E D J W ∈ ipi u E p f W) ⇒ igate u E D2 J2 W2 $ by ex_elim [y2a, y1]
y3b: $ G ⇒ ∃ p ∃ t ∃ f (iprt D p t ∧ ityf D J f ∧ ity u E D J W ∈ ipi u E p f W) $ by weaken [#4]
y3: $ G ⇒ igate u E D2 J2 W2 $ by ex_elim [y3b, y2]

