l25: $ G , ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ hty , ⟨ a , x0 ⟩ ∈ hty ⇒ b = x0 $ by cut [l2, l24]
l26: $ G ⇒ functional hty $ by functional_intro [l25]

lemma c6_hctor_el {u d j k e w: set} (G: hyps) (a b: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ hctor $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ u ∃ d ∃ j ∃ k ∃ e (⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩) $
----
h1: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor , x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ $ by ax
h2: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor , x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by ax
h3: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor , x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = x $ by eq_sym [h2]
