h5: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor , x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ ⇒ ∃ e (⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩) $ by ex_intro [h4]
h6: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor , x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ ⇒ ∃ k ∃ e (⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩) $ by ex_intro [h5]
