g11: $ G , x = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x ∊ hctor ⇒ x ∊ {z | ∃ u ∃ d ∃ j ∃ k ∃ e (z = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩)} $ by ax
