m67: $ G ⇒ i = e $ by eq_sym [m11]
m68: $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , x0 ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_ctor , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons k ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (ictor u e d (fv nvf j) (fv nvf k) w) ⟩ $ by eq_subst [m67, m66]
